  "accessed": "2026-09-09",
  "text": "Home | Japan Expo Paris\n© Yoichi Takahashi\nThank you everyone!\nSee you next year!\nThis year edition is closed. But we can't wait for the next edition\nJuly 8th to 11th 2027\n.\nYôichi Takahashi\nwill be the guest of honnor!\nJapan Expo 2027 starts in...\n2027年日本博覧会は…で始まります\n0\nJOURS\n0\nHEURES\n0\nMINUTES\n0\nSECONDES\nDaruma Awards\nLet's discover this year winners !\nThe best anime? The best manga?\nECG Season 14 - The results\nWho won? Is it your favorite?\nThe answer is here\nA le recherche du nouveau mangaka\nLet's discover the winners of the manga contest by japan Expo and Shûeisha.\nread them here\nA great tournament celebrating the 25th anniversary!\nHere are the names of the winners.\nGet the list here\nWhat\nなに\nThe must-see event\nabout Japan and pop culture!\nWhen\nいつ\nJuly 9th to 12th 2026\nfrom 9:45 am to 6:30 pm\nWhere\nどこ\nParis-Nord Villepinte Exhibition Center, Paris, France\nBuy tickets →\nTHIS YEAR'S EVENT\nこの版では\nGuests\nExhibitors\nSchedule\nGUESTS\nゲスト\nGUEST OF HONOR\nKeisuke Itagaki\nKeisuke Itagaki, the mangaka behind Baki, is stepping up his game at Japan Expo Paris. He is one of our guests of honor for our anniversary edition.\nKeisuke Itagaki will be there on Friday, Saturday, and Sunday.\nHe will also be holding meet-and-greets.\nFr\nSa\nSu\nMANGA\n25TH ANNIVERSARY SPECIAL GUEST\nYOSHIKI\nYOSHIKI, leader of X Japan and The Last Rockstars, returns to Paris to celebrate the 25th anniversary of Japan Expo.\nFr\nMUSIC\nKazuya Kamenashi\nA leading figure in J-Pop for the past 20 years, Kazuya Kamenashi has also pursued a career as an actor, appearing in numerous hit productions, both on television and in film.\nSa\nANIME\nJunya Enoki\nHe is the voice of Yuji Itadori in Jujutsu Kaisen! This voice actor has gained international fame in recent years.\nSa\nANIME\nPERSONA 30TH\nShigenori Soejima\nCharacter designer at Atlus.\nTh\nFr\nVIDEO GAMES\nPERSONA 30TH\nKazuhisa Wada\nPersona general producer.\nTh\nFr\nVIDEO GAMES\nKyû Aiya\nThe author behind the manga version of The Rising of the Shield Hero.\nSa\nSu\nMANGA\nMitsuhiro Arita\nThe renowned illustrator Mitsuhiro Arita is honoring us with his presence at this 2026 edition.\nTh\nFr\nSa\nSu\nTCG\nKyary Pamyu Pamyu\nA true icon of J-Pop, this one-of-a-kind singer has gained worldwide fame thanks to her highly distinctive style.\nSu\nMUSIC\nCyprien\nA huge fan of Japan and pop culture, one of France’s most popular content creators is coming to Japan Expo.\nFr\nSa\nWEB CULTURE\nShinichi Ishizuka\nThis artist is Blue Giant mangaka.\nTh\nFr\nSa\nMANGA\nNumber8\nHe's\nBlue Giant\nscenarist.\nTh\nFr\nSa\nMANGA\nOUR PARTNERS\nFNAC\nFrance TV\nSlash\nFrance Inter\nPrevious slide\nNext slide\nÀ NE PAS MANQUER\nEVENT OF THE DAY\nECG Finales Saison 14\nSa\n17:30 - 19:15\nIchigo stage\nSa\n17:30 - 19:15\nIchigo stage\nSeason 14 Finale for the World Cosplay Contest : Extreme Cosplay Gathering.\nCONTEST\nEVENT OF THE DAY\nAnkama Concert\nSa\n19:30 - 21:00\nYuzu Stage\nSa\n19:30 - 21:00\nYuzu Stage\nAnkama is celebrating its 25th anniversary with a special concert !\nSHOW\nEVENT OF THE DAY\nECG final awards ceremony\nSa\n20:00 - 20:30\nIchigo stage\nSa\n20:00 - 20:30\nIchigo stage\nCome and cheer on the lucky winners of the Extreme Cosplay Gathering Season 14 finale!\nCEREMONY\nYOSHIKI\nYOSHIKI, leader of X Japan and The Last Rockstars, returns to Paris to celebrate the 25th anniversary of Japan Expo.\nLearn more about the event concert\nKeisuke Itagaki\nThe creator of\nBaki\nis the guest of honor!\nDiscover the line-up\nThe Drops of God\nA special panel featuring actor Kazuya Kamenashi and director Kenji Itoso\nLearn more about the event\nAnkama fête ses 25 ans\nAnkama Convention\nConcert classique\nAnk'Osplay\nAnkama sur scène\nDécouvrir le très gros programme\nAkane-banashi\nA lecture and meet-and-greet with authors Yûki Suenaga and Takamasa Moue, publisher Takaaki Kuwabara, and producer Kazuki Endo.\nLearn more about the event\n©Yuki Suenaga, Takamasa Moue / SHUEISHA, Akane-banashi Committee\nPERSONA\nAn Exhibition Celebrating 30 Years\nMeetings with Character Designer Shigenori Soejima and Producer Kazuhisa Wada\nDiscover the line-up\nEN ROUTE POUR JAPAN EXPO\nJoin us on\nTwitch\nevery Monday from 8:00 PM for announcements\nabout new guests, upcoming events, and answers to all your questions!\nTo watch this Twitch video, please accept marketing cookies.\nCookie settings\nYOUR FAVORITE ANIME SONGS LIVE!\nGet ready to sing your favorite anime songs with your favorite Japanese artists!\nMore about Anisong Festa\nEXTREME COSPLAY GATHERING\nCome see the world’s best cosplayers face off at this prestigious competition!\nMore about ECG\nJapanExpo\nJapan Expo 2026 dernier jour [Scène TAKE]\n3014\nviews\n•\na month ago\nNewsletter\nニュースレター\nSubscribe to our newsletter to stay up to date with all Japan Expo events!\nSubscribe to newsletter",
